-end=\"137\">Salaried</strong><span> </span>=<span> </span><strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"153\">বেতনভুক্ত</strong>।</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":115214,"slug":"335-183","question":"4098. A rolling stone gathers no moss. what rolling' is ?","syllabus":"","option1":" Gerund","option2":" Participle","option3":" Verbal noun","option4":" Adjective","option5":"","answer":2,"explain":"<p data-start=\"31\" data-end=\"78\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">বাক্যটি:<span> </span><strong data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"78\">“A rolling stone gathers no moss.”</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"192\">এখানে<span> </span><strong data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"97\">rolling</strong><span> </span>শব্দটি<span> </span><strong data-start=\"105\" data-end=\"114\">stone</strong>-কে বর্ণনা করছে। তাই এটি<span> </span><strong data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"161\">present participle</strong>, যা adjective-এর মতো কাজ করছে।</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":115213,"slug":"335-182","question":"4097. What is the noun of the Word 'Waste'?","syllabus":"","option1":" Waste","option2":" Wasting","option3":" Wastage","option4":" Wasteful","option5":"","answer":3,"explain":"<p><strong data-start=\"28\" data-end=\"37\">Waste</strong><span> নিজেও noun হিসেবে ব্যবহৃত হতে পারে, তবে প্রশ্নে “noun form” হিসেবে সাধারণত </span><strong data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"124\">Wastage</strong><span> বোঝানো হয়েছে।</span></p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":115209,"slug":"335-178","question":"4096. What is the meaning of the word 'euphemism '?","syllabus":"","option1":" vague idea","option2":" in offensive expression","option3":" verbal play","option4":" wise saying","option5":"","answer":2,"explain":"<p data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"152\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"43\" data-end=\"56\">Euphemism</strong><span> </span>অর্থ হলো কোনো<span> </span><strong data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"151\">অপ্রীতিকর, কঠোর বা আপত্তিকর বিষয়কে তুলনামূলকভাবে ভদ্র/নিরীহ শব্দে প্রকাশ করা</strong>।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"224\">উদাহরণ:<span> </span><em data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"177\">“passed away”</em><span> </span>→<span> </span><em data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"188\">“died”</em>-এর পরিবর্তে ব্যবহৃত একটি euphemism।</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":115205,"slug":"335-174","question":"4095. Can you tell me where ________?","syllabus":"","option1":" Does Mr. Ali live","option2":"Mr. Ali doesn’t live","option3":" Mr. Ali lives","option4":"Lives Mr. Ali","option5":"","answer":3,"explain":"<p data-start=\"34\" data-end=\"155\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">Indirect question-এ প্রশ্নবোধক শব্দের পরে<span> </span><strong data-start=\"76\" data-end=\"94\">subject + verb</strong><span> </span>ক্রম থাকে, সরাসরি প্রশ্নের মতো<span> </span><strong data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"151\">does + subject + verb</strong><span> </span>নয়।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"208\"><strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"169\">Correct:</strong><span> </span><em data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"208\">Can you tell me where Mr. Ali lives?</em></p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":115201,"slug":"335-170","question":"4094. কোন একটি জিনিস নির্মাতা ২০% লাভে ও খুচরা বিক্রেতা ২০% লাভে বিক্রয় করে। যদি ঐ জিনিসের নির্মান খরচ ১০০ টাকা হয় তবে খুচরা মূল্য কত?","syllabus":"","option1":" ১৪০","option2":" ১৪৪","option3":" ১২০","option4":"১৪৮","option5":"","answer":2,"explain":"<p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"51\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">নির্মাণ খরচ = ১০০ টাকা</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"84\">নির্মাতার ২০% লাভে বিক্রয়মূল্য:</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><br></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"165\">এরপর খুচরা বিক্রেতা ২০% লাভে বিক্রি করে:</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><br></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"238\">অতএব, খুচরা মূল্য =<span> </span><strong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"238\">১৪৪ টাকা</strong></p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":115200,"slug":"335-169","question":"4093. টাকায় ৩ টি করে আম ক্রয় করে টাকায় ২ টি করে আম বিক্রি করলে শতকরা কত লাভ হবে?","syllabus":"","option1":" ৫০%","option2":" ৩০%","option3":" ৩৩%","option4":"ঘ৩১%","option5":"","answer":1,"explain":"<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"57\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">ধরি, ৩টি আমের ক্রয়মূল্য = ১ টাকা।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"84\">তাহলে ১টি আমের ক্রয়মূল্য:</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mtext> টাকা</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span><br></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"147\">২টি আমের বিক্রয়মূল্য = ১ টাকা।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"176\">তাহলে ৩টি আমের বিক্রয়মূল্য:</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>১</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>৫ টাকা</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span><br></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"213\" data-end=\"238\">লাভ =<span> </span><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></span><span> </span>টাকা।</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"257\">সুতরাং লাভের হার:</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>0.5</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span><br></span></span></p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":115198,"slug":"335-167","question":"4092. নিচের কোন সংখ্যাটি √2 এবং √3 -এর মধ্যবর্তী মূলদ সংখ্যা?","syllabus":"","option1":" (√2+√3)/2","option2":" (√2×√3)/2","option3":" 1.5","option4":" 1.8","option5":"","answer":3,"explain":"<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"29\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">কারণ,</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.414</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.732</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><br></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"91\">এখন,</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.414</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1.732</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span><br></span></span></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"149\">এবং<span> </span><strong data-start=\"124\" data-end=\"148\">১.৫ একটি মূলদ সংখ্যা</strong>।</p>","is_read":false,"is_favorite":false},{"id":115197,"slug":"335-166","question":"4091. 2x²-x-3 এর উৎপাদক কী কী ?","syllabus":"","option1":" (2x+3)(x+1)","option2":" (2x+3)(x-1)","option3":" (2x-3)(x-1)","option4":" (2x-3)(x+1)","option5":"","answer":4,"explain":"<p d